@startuml
!include style.puml
' Straight segments retain readable relationship labels.
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
class ModelManager
class ActiveFilter
interface "Predicate<Person>" as Predicate <<interface>>
class PersonSelectionPredicate
ModelManager --> "0..*" ActiveFilter : activeFilters
ModelManager --> "0..*" Predicate : additionalFilters
ActiveFilter --> "1" Predicate : predicate
PersonSelectionPredicate ..|> Predicate
note bottom of ActiveFilter
Name, email and tag conditions.
All active conditions are combined with AND.
end note
@enduml
